SUMMARY:Daytime Buddhism & Meditation Class
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261028T103500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261028T123000
UID:afc5ef7e98d1155f471eed3d@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:In this series\, we will be exploring the essential teachings 
